{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031810/extras/bb4080cebac08db418c6ab19190e2176.avif?t=1759701173\" width=400 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Curse We Made</strong> is <i>a short ride into a cursed town.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You arrive in Gravebrook by train, stepping into a place abandoned by time and swallowed by shadows. Each street, shop, and room hides handcrafted puzzles, waiting to be solved.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore, you\u2019ll face eerie ghouls, whispering monsters, and unsettling remnants of the town\u2019s past. With every puzzle completed, color returns to the world, and the story of the curse slowly unfolds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031810/extras/3f86bedcdf8c137eeaafa8588d9a6f22.poster.avif?t=1759701173\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031810/extras/3f86bedcdf8c137eeaafa8588d9a6f22.webm?t=1759701173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031810/extras/3f86bedcdf8c137eeaafa8588d9a6f22.mp4?t=1759701173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring hand-drawn art, atmospheric soundscapes, and a cozy-gothic tone, <strong>The Curse We Made</strong> offers a short but unforgettable puzzle-adventure that for fans of cozy, dark, story-driven games.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4031810?t=1759701173","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4031810?t=1759701173","capsule_image":"https://shared.a